  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Talker
  speakerName: Aling Nena
  lines:
  - Ay, ang cute mong aso! Gutom ka? Here, take the pandesal.
  - Pero huwag mong kainin 'yung fishball sa kanal ha. Madumi 'yan, magkakasakit
    ka!
  - If you're not sure, sniff it first.
